Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,. . . . .
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.46,0:00:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it, okay? All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mada nash no survival\Nday. Get away from Go,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.72,0:00:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go! I don't wanna fail. There's\Nno time. Let's get started, go! One,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.08,0:01:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Two, three. Come and\Nfind a way. Fly for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.54,0:01:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,to the top Break out,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.30,0:01:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.48,0:01:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.86,0:01:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,don't
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.12,0:01:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.50,0:01:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I am your cheerful chief here at\NGreen Dolphin Street State Prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.08,0:01:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You may call me Loco Barroco. And also,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.10,0:01:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,this special girl I have with me here\Nis my one and only trusted assistant,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Charlotte.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.16,0:01:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.34,0:02:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Charlotte dear,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.46,0:02:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,if you would please give our\Nprisoners a brief rundown of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.30,0:02:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,what their lives will be like\Nfor the foreseeable future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.66,0:02:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.57,0:02:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Here in this prison facility,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.38,0:02:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,we represent the ideas of our\Ncountry, placing emphasis on equality.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.76,0:02:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wish to wander around\Nor partake in exercise,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.66,0:02:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,you are free to do so\Nin a designated area.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.28,0:02:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You can use the phones, take\Na shower, or read books.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.36,0:02:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,An exemplary prisoner can\Neven have a TV in their cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.84,0:02:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Some may be allowed to work and are given\Na chance to study for a college degree.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.68,0:02:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard her, and that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.62,0:02:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, Charlotte, do\Nyou have a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.94,0:02:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I just remembered, there are rules that\Nmust be followed too, aren't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.28,0:02:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, of course, Charlotte,\Nyou're absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.48,0:02:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,First,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.46,0:02:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,under no circumstances are\Nyou allowed to take off
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.54,0:02:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,the wristband with your\Ndesignated prisoner number.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.34,0:02:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Second, there will be no borrowing\Nor lending things among inmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.78,0:02:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And any metal materials are prohibited.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.14,0:02:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Is wearing earrings still okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.04,0:02:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth right this instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.66,0:02:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The chief is speaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.58,0:03:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No, they're not allowed,\Ninmate FE40536, Jolinkuto.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.44,0:03:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have any further inquiries, please\Nask the guards and they can assist you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.78,0:03:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Orientation is complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.06,0:03:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.74,0:03:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, turn and face to your left!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.42,0:03:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.44,0:03:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear the prison covers\Nthis whole island.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.94,0:03:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, alligator.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.88,0:03:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,FE 40536, welcome to your\Nnew home, cell number 206.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.64,0:03:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Break time for today is come and gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.06,0:03:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The cell opens at 6.30 a .m.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.76,0:03:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Breakfast begins at 7 a .m., but if\Nyou wish to sleep in, you're allowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.22,0:03:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope you two can get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.32,0:03:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.08,0:03:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, nice to meet you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.98,0:04:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The name's Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.44,0:04:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Gwess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.08,0:04:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Monsum? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.40,0:04:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But so much stuff happened today\Nthat I just don't have an appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.58,0:04:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.56,0:04:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're new here, but\Nthe bottom book is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.96,0:04:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to have a problem\Nwith that, you stupid little whore?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.80,0:04:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Bee!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.10,0:04:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, gee, bee!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.82,0:04:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm not interested in fighting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.18,0:04:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw your stuff on the top\Nbed, so I thought it was yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.02,0:04:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.98,0:04:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.46,0:04:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're trying to jack my stuff too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.40,0:04:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I just want to see that closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.40,0:04:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Please listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.46,0:04:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If you open that charm
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.98,0:04:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll find a small stone and\Na picture of my parents inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.54,0:04:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It may be the one I threw away
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.10,0:04:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.26,0:04:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I bought this for two bucks\Nfrom a new inmate the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.02,0:04:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pretty, wouldn't you say? Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.70,0:04:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.61,0:04:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your hands off me you filthy bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.22,0:04:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.13,0:04:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm letting you see it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.42,0:05:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll buy it off of you. Go ahead,\Nname your price. 200 bucks? What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.66,0:05:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear me, dumbass?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.34,0:05:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I said 200 You, you bitch
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.70,0:05:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.46,0:05:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The heck's up with everything?\NSo many strange things happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.34,0:05:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,my mind is racing with thoughts
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.50,0:05:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,i hate this i feel so lonely i could cry
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.24,0:06:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.42,0:06:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,About last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.68,0:06:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.34,0:06:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.25,0:06:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.72,0:06:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.06,0:06:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.08,0:06:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, it's fine if you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.72,0:06:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, that pic of your\Nparents wasn't in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.64,0:06:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I don't think this\Nis the charm you're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.28,0:06:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.60,0:06:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Was anything inside at all? Like a stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.48,0:06:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, there wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.46,0:06:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, can you forgive\Nmy actions from yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.68,0:06:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, I'm a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.80,0:06:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially when meeting new people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.50,0:06:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.08,0:06:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything, it was my fault for assuming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.90,0:06:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still learning how things work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.62,0:06:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Jolene, you're such a nice person.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.12,0:06:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope we can become close friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.52,0:06:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'd like that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.24,0:06:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's the buzzer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.58,0:06:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's breakfast time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.14,0:06:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,See you there, bestie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.32,0:06:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.78,0:06:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.22,0:07:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.58,0:07:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with all this water?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.40,0:07:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My pants are soaking wet now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.52,0:07:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.14,0:07:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but what do you mean\Nthe food's sold out already?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.30,0:07:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't even had my meal yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.80,0:07:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see it's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.04,0:07:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Here at GD, you've got\Nthe freedom to sleep in,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.12,0:07:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,just like you have the\Nfreedom to arrive late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.20,0:07:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you have food\Nprepared for everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.22,0:07:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to at least have a banana left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.36,0:07:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what we call one of\Nthe seven wonders of prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.00,0:07:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.76,0:07:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Jolyne, guess you decided to sleep in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.34,0:07:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so full, I couldn't eat another bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.02,0:07:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Glass, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.18,0:07:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I just see two milks and\Ntwo bananas on your tray?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.18,0:07:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.09,0:07:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I have two?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.36,0:07:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That'd be selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.76,0:07:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, sorry about all\Nthe water I spilled on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.16,0:07:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll clean it all up later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.12,0:07:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I already took care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.90,0:07:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's so nice of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.64,0:07:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.90,0:08:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, this is -
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.60,0:08:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.98,0:08:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Fly over here and take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.54,0:08:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe you can do it with all my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.72,0:08:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do anything\Nwith the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.02,0:08:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, as long as we trust each\Nother, anything is possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.38,0:08:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.00,0:08:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so freaking adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.22,0:08:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you could pull it off for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.60,0:08:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Copy, chat. That was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.84,0:08:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, have a treat, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.40,0:08:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.90,0:08:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, we've talked about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.74,0:08:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't greet me with good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.56,0:08:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's love, you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.18,0:08:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.32,0:08:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's much cuter when you\Nsay you love me, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.02,0:08:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.66,0:08:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.50,0:08:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my perfect little man, Kapi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.20,0:09:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, something harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.72,0:09:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Try flying to my finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.90,0:09:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,To build trust between us, we have to\Ntake risks here and there, Kapi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.64,0:09:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.76,0:09:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get on with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.96,0:09:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Whoa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.22,0:09:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.90,0:09:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do little birdies say,\Nwhoa, where you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.30,0:09:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, now, don't you start messing with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.88,0:09:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you got some superficial idea\Nabout what love and trust should be?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.30,0:09:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.44,0:09:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you've broken that trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.72,0:09:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.66,0:09:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something just go by?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.48,0:09:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A banana?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.08,0:09:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What is up with this weird bird?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.04,0:10:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.46,0:10:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's small, but it has to be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.98,0:10:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a tiny person\Ninside, and she killed them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.26,0:10:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Glass. That woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.40,0:10:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The only explanation for this is\Nshe has that stone from the amulet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.28,0:10:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And it gave her some\Nkind of special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.46,0:10:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But what the hell is\Nwith that small human?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.52,0:11:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.43,0:11:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What is going on now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.60,0:11:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.50,0:11:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My body, did it just shrink?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.94,0:11:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So the culprit was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.70,0:11:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you take my\Ncopy-chan away from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.42,0:11:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, Jolene, Jolene, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.42,0:11:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, I'm starting to\Nlike you more and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.06,0:11:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew we'd be good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.92,0:11:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on with my body?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.86,0:11:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.04,0:11:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jolene, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.44,0:11:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to stop talking, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.42,0:11:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm like that person in the parish!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.72,0:11:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I said stop talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.12,0:11:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Put this on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.08,0:11:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I already removed all the guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.76,0:11:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The parrot had some disadvantages.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.16,0:12:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The poor thing couldn't\Nhold or carry things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.84,0:12:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But rats are better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.42,0:12:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got four paws.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.56,0:12:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,As for him, he was a guard\Nwho got fired for being lazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.30,0:12:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The chief and everyone\Nthinks he already went home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.38,0:12:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.68,0:12:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I told you not to speak, but I'll\Nlet it slide if you do it in a cutesy way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.26,0:12:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Mike, see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.44,0:12:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mommy, I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.46,0:12:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Please feed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.76,0:12:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.16,0:12:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at you, so stinking adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.26,0:12:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's begin your training.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.44,0:12:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster, faster, faster, faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.60,0:12:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me some hustle!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.20,0:12:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now lift them up, Chorokichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.36,0:12:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Chorokichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.20,0:12:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything has a name, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.48,0:12:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,In the beginning was the Word,\Nand the Word was with God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.14,0:12:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Word was God, and\Nthrough Him all was made.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.02,0:12:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And without Him, nothing\Nwas made that had been made.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.32,0:13:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So this mental power that\Nshrank you deserves a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.28,0:13:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How about Gigi Dolls?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.32,0:13:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that will be the\Nname of my mental ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.26,0:13:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's add another book.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.70,0:13:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Naughty girl, are you being cunning\Nand trying to cheat? Hey, now you're
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.66,0:13:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,not going to betray my trust are\Nyou you're not trying to ruin our
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.58,0:13:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Relationship, are you? I'm just messing\Nwith you, congrats. Total kichi, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.92,0:13:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,passed you're going to need that\Ncunning wit for your next task very very
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.12,0:13:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.72,0:13:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,At the far end of this corridor,\Nyou're going to find a control center.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.18,0:13:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Your objective is to get\Nto that switch over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.90,0:13:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It can unlock all the cells\Nand doors in this prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.78,0:13:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.10,0:13:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.86,0:13:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If we work together, we can escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.78,0:14:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,For some reason, I can't\Nmake myself smaller.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.38,0:14:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Though luckily, we have you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.26,0:14:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's important we trust each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.12,0:14:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, the actual\Ncommencement is further ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.30,0:14:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,For this mission, you just need to\Ninvestigate everything beyond this corridor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.18,0:14:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think we\Ncan escape like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.64,0:14:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.62,0:14:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go forgetting I told you\Nto speak in a cutesy way now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.30,0:14:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This control center?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.88,0:14:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,How exactly am I supposed\Nto crawl over to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.78,0:14:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a cutie!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.30,0:14:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my adorable baby rat girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.66,0:14:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't ask me, you dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.20,0:14:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Figuring that part out is your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.68,0:14:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Look above you, there's\Na surveillance camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.42,0:14:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be in its blind spot\Nif you go under the handrail.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.06,0:14:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So just go straight below it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.52,0:14:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And keep the rat corpse on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.34,0:14:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, hurry up and go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.02,0:15:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.93,0:15:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.06,0:15:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Girl with the headband!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.38,0:15:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.68,0:15:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me your name and prison number!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.14,0:15:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The number is FE18081\Nand my name is Gwess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.06,0:15:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just taking a walk\Naround the corridors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.44,0:15:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't have any business here,\Nget away from the gate and leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.64,0:15:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, Mr. Guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.02,0:15:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There are four steel doors in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.48,0:15:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder which one of them\Nleads to the control center.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.24,0:15:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And there are cameras in the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.08,0:15:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.78,0:15:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.69,0:15:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it so tight?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.00,0:15:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Suddenly...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.14,0:15:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.05,0:15:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that sound just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.68,0:15:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, man, I heard that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.82,0:15:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.50,0:15:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh crap, that's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.32,0:16:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My body's getting bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.08,0:16:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just a coffee maker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.94,0:16:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't that the sound it\Nmakes when it's ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.74,0:16:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.26,0:16:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.98,0:16:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.70,0:16:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it because Guest left?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.60,0:16:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is distance related to her ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.50,0:16:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I definitely heard it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.02,0:16:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be in here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.76,0:16:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, shit, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.88,0:16:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.32,0:16:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, get out of the way! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.32,0:16:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's freaking hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.54,0:16:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, YB!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.78,0:16:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.86,0:16:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you idiots it was the coffee\Nmaker, but you wouldn't listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.76,0:16:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.84,0:16:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw this investigation!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.82,0:16:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to fit through the bars\Nbefore my body grows any bigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.98,0:16:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.90,0:16:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,G. G. Dolph.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.92,0:17:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.94,0:17:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,G... G...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.14,0:17:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.40,0:17:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like a doll,\Nbut it's transparent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.78,0:17:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Same as my thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.12,0:17:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a physical manifestation of\NGwess' energy that no one else can see!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.24,0:17:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How about GG dolls?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.26,0:17:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that will be the\Nname of my mental ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.14,0:17:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This baby doll from hell is what shrunk me
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.36,0:17:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,and ripped the guard and\Nthe parrot to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.80,0:17:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That must mean it was just chilling\Ninside the rat with me the entire time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.54,0:17:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm willing to bet that Gwess has no\Nidea her ability weakens if she's far away,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.78,0:17:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,so she doesn't know my\Nbody's growing back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.64,0:17:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I've got a murderous\Nmunchkin chasing me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.04,0:18:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,down because it thinks\Nthat I was running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.24,0:18:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't get out of here,\Nthe thing's gonna kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.98,0:18:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.58,0:18:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, Dolph.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.40,0:18:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I ever do to\Ndeserve a fate like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.32,0:18:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is how I go out?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.56,0:18:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,By this creature?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.22,0:18:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get through!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.08,0:18:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,G, G, G, G.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.64,0:18:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.82,0:19:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No, a whole clump of threads.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.84,0:19:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be the form that\Nmy energy takes. A clump.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.24,0:19:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,When they gather in clump,\Nit becomes three-dimensional.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.32,0:19:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What a concept!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.06,0:19:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Scream your heart out, bastard child!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.22,0:19:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now call Gwess over here and hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.84,0:19:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, I wasn't expecting you to\Nalso have an ability. Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.50,0:19:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.62,0:19:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,please, Jolene, I'm begging you, stop\Nstrangling my Gigi doll so tightly!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.30,0:19:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I don't want to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.58,0:19:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus on shrinking my body enough\Nso I can squeeze out of here,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.54,0:19:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but only just a little, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.18,0:19:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, you can even\Nhave the bottom bunk, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.14,0:19:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we've been through a\Nlot, but please don't hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.52,0:19:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, though, I'd like you to speak\Nto me all cutesy from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.78,0:19:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hurry and do it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.56,0:19:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All right now hand over the amulet that\Nincludes the stone inside and I want to know
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.62,0:20:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,who you bought it from too of course whatever\Nyou say that'll be two hundred dollars
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.54,0:20:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,shut the fuck up you\Nbitch just tell me the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.84,0:20:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,name before I kill you okay I got it well
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.54,0:20:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure but I think her name was
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.08,0:20:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes Hermes I don't\Nknow her that well here
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.94,0:20:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Kidding
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.42,0:20:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.86,0:20:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mr. Guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.44,0:20:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.96,0:20:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a prisoner past the gunpoint!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.58,0:20:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.06,0:20:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey you, the hell are you doing in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.54,0:20:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you get past the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.56,0:20:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Prison break!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.56,0:20:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Code 999!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.14,0:20:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be the end of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.18,0:20:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If you didn't know, that guard\Njust went to pick up his shotgun,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.84,0:21:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and since you're behind the door,\Nhe's got the right to shoot your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.20,0:21:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No questions asked!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.58,0:21:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Jillian!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.14,0:21:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say it's just what you deserve!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.94,0:21:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You hurt my feelings, and\Nnow you're gonna die for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.84,0:21:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Good freaking grief, Quest. Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.76,0:21:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And listen, you said everything\Nhas a name, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.18,0:21:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll name my ability, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.38,0:21:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be Stone Ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.06,0:21:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Because somehow I'm going to free\Nmyself from the Sea of Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.70,0:21:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.84,0:21:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.16,0:21:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.56,0:21:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.46,0:21:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's some sort of\Nhierarchy in this prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.90,0:21:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,then I'll follow it as much as I need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.70,0:21:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm the one who's going\Nto be giving out orders here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.58,0:21:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now shrink me down and get me\Nthe hell out of this hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.90,0:21:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.10,0:21:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.10,0:21:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gone. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.18,0:21:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really sure you saw her?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.28,0:22:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, but I only\Nsaw her from the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.34,0:22:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.28,0:22:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.74,0:22:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I cope,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.28,0:22:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,my head is filled with hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.62,0:22:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.06,0:22:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,other than here
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.44,0:22:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.74,0:22:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.98,0:23:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering about my destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.92,0:23:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.92,0:23:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,about all the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.60,0:23:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,things I'd like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.48,0:23:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,to do in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.90,0:23:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.36,0:23:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A distant dreamer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.28,0:23:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming far away
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.68,0:23:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,From today
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.36,0:23:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.72,0:24:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
